 - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.
 
 Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).
+
+## Weather display
+
+- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,me,logout}`, `/api/weather` (list/search/create), `/api/weather/{id}` (get/replace/delete), `/api/weather/recent`. Write operations need `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from login.
+- Data: SQLite at `data/app.db` (override the directory with `DATA_DIR`). Sample reports are seeded on first start.
+- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS (`src/index.css` is the Tailwind entry). `npm run typecheck` runs `tsc`; `npm run build` type-checks and builds.
+- Local dev: `gunicorn --pythonpath backend app:app --bind 127.0.0.1:8000` and `npm run dev` in `frontend/` (proxies `/api`).
